# NJ PFAS mortality - quantile g-computation to assess joint effects of
# PFOA, PFOS, PFNA

# Objectives: Estimate association of all-cause, prostate cancer, and CVD 
# mortality per 1-quartile increase in PFOA, PFOS and PFNA jointly. Assess
# whether all PFAS analytes work in synergy of antagonistically

# Inputs: long_list_imp.Rda (generated by XX script)
# Outputs: Tables of quantile g-computation results

# Created by: Hari Iyer
# Date: 9/23/2026
########################################################################

